# NAME: NVIDIA_Direct
# SOURCE: v2fly/domain-list-community/data/nvidia (@cn); NVIDIA official driver page/API
# SOURCE-VERSION: cb663f66025ef3be1c1c7eb367dfac5f46645ffc (nvidia list last change)
# MAINTAINED-BY: zhbcn/Rules
# Use before NVIDIA; domain routing cannot distinguish regional paths on www.nvidia.com.
# Driver lookup: www.nvidia.com/en-us/drivers/ references gfwsl.geforce.com.
# DriverManualLookup returns uk.download.nvidia.com; download suffix includes regional mirrors.
# services.gfe.nvidia.com: legacy GFE update service; exact host, not all gfe.nvidia.com.
# QX-COMPAT: COMPLETE-DOMAIN-IP; proxy is a placeholder; use force-policy and opt-parser=false.

host-suffix,nvidia.cn,proxy
host-suffix,geforce.cn,proxy
host-suffix,gputechconf.cn,proxy
host-suffix,download.nvidia.com,proxy
host,gfwsl.geforce.com,proxy
host,services.gfe.nvidia.com,proxy
